From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d2d1: DeviceContext2 resources, GDI metafiles, resource textures (3621)

d2d1: ID2D1DeviceContext2 resources and drawing, GDI metafiles, resource textures

New objects.c: ink (segments, StreamAsGeometry as the union of the nib swept
along the Bezier, bounds, DrawInk), ink style, gradient mesh (patches, world
bounds, DrawGradientMesh as a grid of colored quads per patch), image sources
from WIC and DXGI (DrawImage draws them), transformed image sources
(orientation and scale), 3D lookup tables, sprite batches (DrawSpriteBatch),
SVG glyph styles, GDI metafiles (ID2D1Factory1::CreateGdiMetafile, Stream,
GetBounds, DrawGdiMetafile played on the GDI interop DC). Also
GetGlyphRunWorldBounds, EndDraw on a command list target, geometry group
StrokeContainsPoint, effect context resource textures (Create/Find, Update),
and SetCached on the blend/border transforms (a hint) as a TRACE.
Careful mode (browsers and Office use d2d1).
